Objective: Synthesize the provided game design elements into a single, comprehensive, and cohesive Game Design Document. You must integrate the theme, player abilities, upgrades, enemies, bosses, and level ideas into a unified and logically structured narrative and mechanical framework.

Output Format: A single, detailed text document. Use the generate_text tool to draft the content and call system_objective_fulfilled once the final document is produced.

User Input / Context:
Game Theme: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_game_theme","title":"Game Theme"}}
Player Abilities: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_player_abilities","title":"Player Abilities"}}
Weapon Upgrades: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_weapon_upgrades","title":"Weapon Upgrades"}}
Device Upgrades: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_device_upgrades","title":"Device Upgrades"}}
Enemy Types: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_enemy_types","title":"Enemy Types"}}
